cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use feynkit in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: feynkit
abstract: >-
  A Python package for Feynman integrals via GKZ systems: Symanzik
  polynomials, parametric representations, the GKZ system, the Newton
  polytope, the toric ideal, symmetries, Landau singularities and an
  analysis report.
authors:
  - family-names: Denham
    given-names: Byron
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-09-25"
repository-code: https://github.com/byrondenham/feynkit
url: https://github.com/byrondenham/feynkit
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Feynman integrals
  - GKZ systems
  - A-hypergeometric functions
  - Newton polytopes
  - toric ideals
